Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《旧伤》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,和曾经亲爱的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is never an easy thing to see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.43,0:00:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天人永隔\N{\fnArial\fs30}a friend once loved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让人难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}now absent breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.33,0:00:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should yet walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该傻傻地笑着\N{\fnArial\fs30}That foolish grin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续做着自由之梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dreams of a life beyond these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天一破晓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night breaks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就得醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we must all wake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望天神能让时光回溯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would the gods turn back the sun…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.03,0:01:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我回到他的身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and set me in his place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为荣耀而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fought with honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.06,0:01:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As did you both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.73,0:01:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为了博孩子欢心 就让他命丧黄泉\N{\fnArial\fs30}His heart was stilled for a boy's amusement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.23,0:01:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何荣耀可言？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the honor in that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro是作为角斗士 离开尘世的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro left this world a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,也将作为角斗士 被人怀念\N{\fnArial\fs30}And shall be remembered as such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将作为一名丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be remembered as a husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.06,0:02:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}A father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.23,0:02:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及共同抗敌的盟友 被人怀念\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a friend amongst enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:02:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aurelia啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aurelia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.53,0:03:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死在你的剑下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he perished by your sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他敬你如兄长啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loved you as a brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受不了这个打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going to take this loss well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁又能怪他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who can fucking blame him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calavius轻飘飘一句话 就杀了我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calavius slaughters my stock at the whim of his maggot, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,唾弃我的雄心壮志\N{\fnArial\fs30}shits upon my ambitions, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.53,0:03:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我在自己的地盘受辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}mocking me in my own house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这绝不是受不受得了打击的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not a loss to be taken fucking well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.33,0:03:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迟早要以牙还牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one that will be answered in kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:04:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是行政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他作对…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To move against him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不过是个普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is but a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all men fall, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,都对他们俯首帖耳而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}beneath the heel of their hubris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.63,0:04:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quintus啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quintus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事先暂搁一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn thoughts toward other matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia怎样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of Ilithyia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说动他丈夫 对我们进行资助了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she move to secure us her husband's patronage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.30,0:04:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经前去罗马见Glaber了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has departed for Rome to meet Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.23,0:04:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了副将的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}The support of a legatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要掌握政权 将指日可待\N{\fnArial\fs30}should be more than enough to gain political office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾 Calavius有生之年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only regret Calavius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,见不到Batiatus这个「卑微」的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}will not live to see the "unworthy" name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,平步青云了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Batiatus so elevated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.90,0:04:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个想法…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very thought of discovery…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让人不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}It turns the stomach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意已决 等着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it a thing of iron, and see it settled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么消息？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧 别让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak, caress my ear with words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对会让您心神愉悦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will find them soft and pleasing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在行政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We set upon the magistrate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,离城的路上 袭击了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the road leaving the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.70,0:04:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫和马车呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guards and wagon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,都安置妥当了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attended to as instructed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.53,0:04:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man himself removed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,已到了指定地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the appointed place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ashur呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:04:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜幕降临后 我会接替他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will relieve him by cover of night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.73,0:05:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会过去看看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall accompany.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要盯着他的双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would gaze into the man's eyes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看它们在我的淫威之下 是如何一番神色\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see the power of my reflection in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.23,0:05:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,完事后 我再答谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until such time, avail yourself of my hospitality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,美酒 佳人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wine, women…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.53,0:05:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样也不能少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both would suit me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.53,0:05:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,理所当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人 告辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,木已成舟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.26,0:05:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,才刚开个头而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only just begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 这就是骁勇的卡普亚战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold, the glorious champion of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有心事 自然力不从心\N{\fnArial\fs30}A heavy heart weighs a man's sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.03,0:05:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟的过世 令每位角斗士都很伤感\N{\fnArial\fs30}The loss of a brother is heartfelt by every gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:06:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不应以眼泪来怀念他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We honor him not with tears, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,而应当代之以 竞技场上血染的风采\N{\fnArial\fs30}but with blood spilled in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话才像是一位真正的战神该说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoken as a true champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,和庞贝城的角斗赛即将来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}The games against Pompeii approach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前 我败给了Solonius的终极勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years I have been robbed of the primus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.00,0:06:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他的不择手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Solonius and his bribes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 是我们的主人救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally it is secured by our Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.80,0:06:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 会派谁上场呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who fights?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤心的小娘儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman who grieves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.13,0:06:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.73,0:06:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人传召你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are summoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的像我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this truly my likeness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着岁月流逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have so many years passed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这块石雕 是否也会刻上满脸皱纹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that marble must be etched with such lines?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.13,0:06:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个活着的人 都会看到自己的脸渐渐衰老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that every man lived to see his face so marred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,光滑的皮肤渐渐布满皱纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the wretched pass smooth of skin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.93,0:07:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro的死 一直在我脑海中盘旋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro's death has been foremost in my thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,损失了这么一员大将\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seizes the breast{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心痛如绞\N{\fnArial\fs30}to lose a gladiator of such standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个比喻不恰当\N{\fnArial\fs30}The comparison is false, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于儿子来说 他失去的是父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a son losing his father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.63,0:07:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于妻子来说 她失去的是丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wife, her husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.53,0:07:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,今后肯定会很艰难吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A burden, to be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.53,0:07:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管他知道危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet he was aware of risk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是自愿甘之如饴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and took them of his free will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.70,0:07:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一名角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是小孩在玩过家家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a child's plaything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官和他儿子 让我们如此痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The magistrate and his whelp have caused us both pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应你 这事绝不会就这么不了了之的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will not go unanswered, I promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让他们付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be of service towards the deed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.90,0:07:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这个消息能让你好过些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take comfort from knowing its intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算让你参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have your focus turned towards{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞贝城的竞技赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}the games of Pompeii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.26,0:07:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个混蛋Solonius\N{\fnArial\fs30}That perfumed shit Solonius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是靠着溜须拍马 让自己保有终极勇士的名额\N{\fnArial\fs30}always secured the primus by inserting tongue in ass, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.86,0:07:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到 竟会被本城其最讨厌的对手击败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to be crushed by our city's hated rival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:07:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今年\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失宠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he falls out of favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年 Batiatus家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}This year the house of Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,将捍卫荣誉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}secures the honor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,送雨的使者 将对阵Pericles\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringer of rain, to face Pericles, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞贝城的巨人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Titan of Pompeii!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场终极决斗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is to be sine missione?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.50,0:08:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不谈宽恕 不讲仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}No quarter given, no mercy shown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.70,0:08:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the purse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,按竞技赛的标准计算\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be on a footing with the match itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能付给Varro的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see it paid to Varro's wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢得的巨款\N{\fnArial\fs30}A substantial sum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.26,0:08:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 全部都给她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would see it all past from your fingers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,连同日后我在竞技场上赢到的所有钱 都给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with future winnings that I claim in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真大度\N{\fnArial\fs30}A noble gesture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会照做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One I shall see matched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会这样做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了Varro？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Varro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.13,0:08:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为你这样做的 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would do it for you, Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道他的家人有人照料\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you have peace of mind, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.16,0:08:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能安心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing his family is attended to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些伤心事 对你明显影响巨大\N{\fnArial\fs30}These sad events have obviously taken their toll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好休息 务必对那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest, and be reassured that those responsible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,使我们痛苦的人 还以颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}for our pain will soon drink deep of their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.90,0:09:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro的事 我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is regretful, what happened to Varro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.56,0:09:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你的眼神 知道你有多想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw in your eyes how you craved to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,违抗命令 不杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}defy order of his death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.43,0:09:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没这样做 真可耻啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shame you did not attempt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.30,0:10:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goat-fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就知道会这样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你还废话什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you fucking bleat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我并肩作战呢 兄弟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight by my side, brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像连体婴一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a suckling babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想证明自己的实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would prove myself alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And die the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.76,0:10:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的战神 看起来精神不振啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our champion does not look to form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 天神惩罚了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm, the gods punish him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所为何事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what offense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.66,0:10:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你装糊涂呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking jest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.73,0:10:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro's blood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.66,0:10:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还令他的手为之刺痛呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}still wet upon his hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是迫不得已 听令行事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}His hands were removed from choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是要我杀了自己的兄弟 我宁愿先死一步…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would die before I would kill my own brother…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 谁来照顾你兄弟的家人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who would see to your brother's family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.43,0:10:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会怎么办 Duro？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What answer do you give, Duro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.76,0:10:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩都死了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}With both of you dead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.33,0:10:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来照顾他妻子？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would see to his wife?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.33,0:10:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他的孩子？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}His child?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.53,0:10:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的兄弟没有妻儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother has no wife or child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.13,0:11:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的色雷斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking Thracians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.16,0:11:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚叫你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called your name…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不像平时的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not appear yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.40,0:11:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是主人派你来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Dominus send you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望看到你振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would see your spirits raised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do not deserve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伤口…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wound…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是道擦伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.43,0:11:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro比我惨多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro suffered worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扶你进房\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will help you to your cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mira啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mira.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见 那个和你在一起的男人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man I saw you with…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是主人派我去服侍他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ordered to tend to his needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他没那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}He means nothing to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such is not my concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.73,0:12:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是为了保护我妻子 才受伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man was wounded trying to protect my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次 你和他在一起的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next you lay with him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,请代我转达谢意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have you offer my gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.33,0:13:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,委屈您屈居陋室了 行政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies for the accommodation, Magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take comfort knowing that you will not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.56,0:13:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,您不必忍耐太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}have to endure for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是疯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this madness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理智得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only reason, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,受伤至深 惟出此下策\N{\fnArial\fs30}born of a clear mind and wounded heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,受伤？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wounded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未伤害过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have done you no injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人伤了别人 却完全不自知\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man's crimes escape his lofty notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I intend to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,使你从这世上解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this fucking world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你有何意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever your disagreement, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.43,0:13:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来心平气和地谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}let us discuss it as civilized men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你搞错人了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you mistake me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身份卑微\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am but a base animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个受歧视的下贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A beast to be ridden and disregarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接受了我的热情款待\N{\fnArial\fs30}You accept my hospitality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.83,0:13:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,进了我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enter my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃了我的食物 喝了我的酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break bread, drink my wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,却当面唾弃我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to spit in my face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.80,0:14:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,「把政治留给那些为此而生的人们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Leave politics to the men who have the breeding for it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Offense was not my intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想使你免于蒙受更多的耻辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sought only to spare you further humiliation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是为我好？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare me?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我好个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have power to spare shit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这贱人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}you pathetic cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在说啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now speak the words!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说我家怎么样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me my heritage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我的家族如今已在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me my family name bears no weight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和那些傻逼眼中一文不值！\N{\fnArial\fs30}among you and your noble cock eaters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.73,0:14:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.80,0:14:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚下留情吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps if you move your foot…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他抬起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想听我说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish words from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.66,0:15:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我好好听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}May you listen to them well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.33,0:15:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太可笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a jest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经低声下气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man tolerated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.43,0:15:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为拥有斯巴达克斯这张王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of his ownership of Spartacus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的救世主\N{\fnArial\fs30}the savior of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他倒下之日\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he falls, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.50,0:15:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你灭亡之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will quickly follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种破地儿里 拴在椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tied to a fucking chair in the filth and mire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还这么猖狂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet the man provokes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.33,0:15:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗 Batiatus？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still do not see it, do you, good Batiatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你相比 我位高权重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are beneath me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不管是在哪辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you always will be, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,都拼不过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this life or the next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀 伤你自尊了 快安慰自己去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what you must to balm your wounded pride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.93,0:15:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会求你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not beg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,求我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.73,0:15:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你早就没权力求我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the time for begging is long past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经制定好周密计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plans have been set in motion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你… 和年轻的Numerius\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you… and young Numerius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.43,0:16:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,与我儿子有何关联？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does my boy to do with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在成年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a man now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也该粉墨登场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He too has a part to play in our little drama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus, you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着点他 别出差错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attend he does not injure himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,到点时 我再来见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see him fresh for the appointed time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好吗 主人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this wise, Dominus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们如果…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps if we err…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.76,0:16:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,少废话 按计划说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take hold of your cock and follow the plan, uh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已登上贼船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are committed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,下不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are committed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.80,0:16:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技赛快开始了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The games approach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,击败庞贝城的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove yourselves against Pompeii, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.73,0:16:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,为Batiatus家族争光！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and honor the house of Batiatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我兄弟无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother meant nothing by his remarks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个直肠子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spoke his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都知道他有话直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thoughts shared by many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想休息了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish to rest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想休息时 会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I do, I shall tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.70,0:17:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我伤到你了吗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I hurt you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.93,0:17:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,战神？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去疗伤吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tend to the wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人都半死不活了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man is half dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的就没注意到吗？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't notice he needed fucking attention?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为 他就是为Varro的死有点失神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought him only distracted by Varro's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还能与庞贝城的角斗士一战吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will he be able to fight against Pompeii?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发高烧呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He burns with fever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.13,0:18:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,能捱到比赛前就是奇迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A miracle if he lives to the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.53,0:18:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我份所需药物的清单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Provide a list of all that is needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ashur去集市了 他会搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur heads to market, he will see it filled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 悉心照料他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let not a moment pass with him unattended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,若需要帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch Mira from the villa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就去庄园把Mira找来\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you need assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.26,0:18:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像有点喜欢那女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has some feelings towards the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.73,0:18:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在旁照料 有助于他康复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her touch may aid recovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.50,0:18:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的战神不能倒下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our champion can not fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.93,0:18:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟庞贝城的终级勇士之战 终于快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The primus against Pompeii finally mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果老天却这么整我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the gods jam cock in ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.66,0:18:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果斯巴达克斯不出战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowd will turn upon me when they{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,民众会骂死我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}learn Spartacus does not fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许合适的替代者 可以平息民怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps they will be appeased with suitable replacement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.90,0:18:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了斯巴达克斯 还有谁能击败他们那该死的战神？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who but Spartacus could best their fucking champion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.36,0:18:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实有一个人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is but one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,终级勇士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The primus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus终于想起了我的价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last Batiatus remembers my worth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我将重返竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I shall take the sand again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让竞技场的黄沙 被Pericles的鲜血染红！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see it turn red with the blood of Pericles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小点声啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soften your words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.36,0:19:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会被发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will be discovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们爱听就听呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will let them hear us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我就是神！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, I am a god!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将夺回我的称号\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will reclaim my title, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚战神…\N{\fnArial\fs30}champion of Capua…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听了好像不太开心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The news does not please you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.30,0:19:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要看到你还活着 我就已经很开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It fills my heart with joy, to see you so alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想看到你去冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would have you remain so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.93,0:19:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Naevia啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.06,0:19:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟终极勇士的比赛 可是会要命的啊 Crixus\N{\fnArial\fs30}The primus is a fight to the death, Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经好几月没进过竞技场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been absent the arena many months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.73,0:19:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果Pericles是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Pericles were…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.73,0:19:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能肯定呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be certain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我永远都不会离开你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I will never leave your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.33,0:19:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算死神想把我们分开 他也会怕得发抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death itself will tremble if it tries to part us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天 在我胜利之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow when I take victory, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.16,0:20:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会向上席的你 投去注视\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will look to you in the pulvinus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩好好分享胜利时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will share the moment alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱已经到手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hand is weighted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.43,0:20:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该付诸行动了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now float your tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.36,0:20:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的主人有更大的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}My master has greater concerns{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要他去操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}requiring his attentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么事 能让老Batiatus如此心烦意乱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What plagues good Batiatus to such distraction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.63,0:20:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不会了解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matters beyond your worries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.80,0:20:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 它们也困扰着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet they clearly trouble you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.96,0:20:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下你的顾忌 告诉我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confide, lift your burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.43,0:20:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经变得不计后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has grown reckless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.83,0:21:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对权力和复仇的渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}His thirst for power{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.23,0:21:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙蔽了他的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}and vengeance clouds judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.13,0:21:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上跟你见面我可是冒了很大的风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have taken too great a risk meeting with you this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.93,0:21:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我迟到之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must to the apothecary, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.03,0:21:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须到药店去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I am overdue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 终有一日 Batiatus家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, very soon, the house of Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.30,0:21:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,会轰然倒塌\N{\fnArial\fs30}will come crashing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.03,0:21:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心可别被碎石瓦砾给埋了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not find yourself buried in the rubble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我按住他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking hold him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 来瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, lick my hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.86,0:22:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个傻蛋还活着啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pig-fucker's still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.93,0:22:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对主人来说 你就只是这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you are to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,金子 用血和肉换来的金子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold, mined from blood and meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.56,0:23:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,向斯巴达克斯致敬啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All hail Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.70,0:23:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡之影的屠灭者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slayer of the shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,送雨的使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringer of the rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人的战神…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champion of the Romans…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.26,0:24:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,死吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.06,0:24:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的庞贝就这么点能耐吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the best the great Pompeii has to offer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.13,0:24:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕今年的比赛会让人失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear the games will be a disappointment this year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.36,0:24:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点饭前的小菜算不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}These early skirmishes count for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.93,0:25:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利与否 是由终极勇士决定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the primus that decides the victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.36,0:25:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um hum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.63,0:25:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的斯巴达克斯不出场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absent your man Spartacus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.70,0:25:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚将会再次陷入庞贝的阴影之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capua shall once again find itself in PompeiI's shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.93,0:25:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许Crixus能带来光芒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps Crixus will bring light to the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.53,0:25:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.93,0:25:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这高卢人还活着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowd will be amazed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.83,0:25:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众们会非常吃惊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the Gaul is still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.60,0:25:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus向我们保证 他已经从伤病中恢复过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus assures us he's recovered from his injuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.86,0:25:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他能活下来 可真是让人惊奇啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he survived at all is impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.33,0:25:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没有庞贝角斗士和Theokoles交战之后 还能活下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No gladiator from Pompeii ever lived against Theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.23,0:25:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的Numerius说得很对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young Numerius cuts to the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.96,0:25:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他从父亲那儿继承的天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}A talent he learned from his father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.96,0:25:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,善良的Calavius会不会到场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does good Calavius intend to grace us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.46,0:25:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让赛事增辉啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with his presence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.23,0:25:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,日子过得可真快\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day grows short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.13,0:25:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在Picentia做一些重要的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Critical matters of trade in Picentia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.00,0:25:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定是推迟了归程的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have been delayed upon his return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.13,0:25:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定他会很快加入我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am certain he will join us presently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.20,0:26:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aulus啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aulus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.26,0:26:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 你这该死的老色鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up, you fucking goat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.06,0:26:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人不是花钱让你做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus does not pay you to dream of tits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.46,0:26:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩女人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cunts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.13,0:26:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要敢再踢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place foot on me again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.13,0:26:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就让你再一次变成瘸子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find yourself once more a cripple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.10,0:26:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们的协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the stakes we deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.70,0:26:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果Calavius逃走的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Calavius were to escape…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.00,0:26:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck your mouth shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.06,0:26:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man has not stirred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.46,0:26:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是也活不了了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor does he breathe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.20,0:26:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus有令 不到约定时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus commanded he not expire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.00,0:26:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他决不能断气！\N{\fnArial\fs30}until the appointed hour!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.53,0:26:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着 你他妈唠叨啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still alive, you fucking woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.03,0:26:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒吧 虚荣鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise yourself, peacock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.00,0:26:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.86,0:26:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.20,0:26:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我无关…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will share no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.23,0:26:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.70,0:27:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He breathes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.23,0:27:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man is still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.73,0:27:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aulus啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aulus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.63,0:27:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你们两个都钉上十字架！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have you both crucified!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.70,0:27:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你们的主人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your master…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.30,0:27:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aulus 够了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aulus, enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.10,0:27:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aulus啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aulus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.23,0:27:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.36,0:27:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.63,0:27:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然丑得想妓女的穴 但你不会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugly as a whore's gash, but you will live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.36,0:27:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,回训练场去 让医生帮你治疗下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to the ludus and have medicus attend to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.00,0:27:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你够胆一个人看守他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have the balls to see this through alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.10,0:27:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.10,0:27:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very large.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.50,0:27:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.96,0:28:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等不到头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wait an eternity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.03,0:28:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不让我作为终极勇士登场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't I begin our primus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.13,0:28:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,群众威胁要暴动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowd threatens riot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.06,0:28:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等不了Calavius了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can await Calavius no longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.53,0:28:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,善良的Batiatus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.40,0:28:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能以我丈夫的名义 介绍终极勇士吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you present the primus on my husband's behalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.76,0:28:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 如果你觉得可行的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you think it proper…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.00,0:28:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,请吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.03,0:28:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.03,0:28:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的行政官哪去了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the fucking Magistrate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.20,0:28:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们按捺不住了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want some action!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.40,0:28:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚人民！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.43,0:28:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 谨代表行政官Calavius\N{\fnArial\fs30}In honor of Magistrate Calavius, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.76,0:28:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他个人 为了你们 因事务繁忙而缺席了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is absent attending vital business on your behalf, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.53,0:28:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请 终极勇士对决庞贝勇士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I present the primus against Pompeii!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.90,0:29:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus! Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.53,0:29:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus! Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.43,0:29:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus! Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.33,0:29:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.16,0:29:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们都渴望见到斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we all desire to see Spartacus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.40,0:29:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,踏上竞技场！\N{\fnArial\fs30}take to the sands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.96,0:29:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但可惜的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sadly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.46,0:29:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今日见不到手执利刃的他了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}this day shall not see him with sword in hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.63,0:29:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是仍有可喜之处！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet there is cause to rejoice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.13,0:29:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个光荣的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a glorious moment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.60,0:29:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说是众望所归！\N{\fnArial\fs30}much anticipated!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.90,0:29:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为今天将见证 卡普亚垂青之子之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}For it marks the return to the arena{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.06,0:29:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,重归竞技场…\N{\fnArial\fs30}of one of Capua's favored sons…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.50,0:29:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是Crixus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.83,0:29:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,高卢角斗士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murmillo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.66,0:29:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都忘了我带给他们的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have forgotten the honor that I have brought them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.00,0:30:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么此刻 你就要让他们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it is time you reminded them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.70,0:30:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁才是他们真正的战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}who their true champion is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.20,0:30:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚人民看起来并不喜欢你的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears Capua does not care for your selection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.46,0:30:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要面对的对手邪恶异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}He faces a most vile opponent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.23,0:30:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,发迹于庞贝洞穴之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}belched from the bowels of Pompeii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.00,0:30:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请Pericles！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you Pericles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.36,0:30:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,色雷斯角斗士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thraex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.33,0:30:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pericles啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pericles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.30,0:31:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这场比赛真是易如反掌！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray the match is overly brief!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.53,0:31:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看到他一脸横肉的笑脸变成哭脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see his fat smirk removed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.43,0:31:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,下令吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.60,0:31:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.53,0:32:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.80,0:32:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈怎么搞的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the fucking cause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.00,0:32:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条狗 很快就要被制伏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dog, soon to be put down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.50,0:32:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.20,0:32:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻着一股尿骚味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smells like piss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.13,0:32:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是莨菪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henbane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.30,0:32:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你好好休息的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's to make you rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.10,0:32:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去吃东西 再睡上几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need food and a few hours sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.70,0:32:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他情况好转 就立刻找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come for me if his condition changes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.16,0:33:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞贝万岁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pompeii!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.80,0:33:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是一年 又一位卡普亚的「垂青之子」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another year, another "favored son" of Capua{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.73,0:33:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,将被埋葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}gone to grass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.73,0:33:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛还没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}The match is not yet concluded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.63,0:33:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,血淋淋的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Formalities of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.23,0:33:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man is finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.10,0:33:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus有狮子般的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus has the heart of a lion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.93,0:33:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.20,0:33:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还能站…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He yet rises…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.73,0:33:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.80,0:33:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucretia啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.53,0:33:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.83,0:33:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她喝点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.26,0:33:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼见手下即将被屠戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife does not feel well at the sight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.20,0:33:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的妻子也于心不忍啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your man about to be slaughtered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.10,0:34:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.70,0:34:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,太热了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the heat…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.06,0:34:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,送她回庄园\N{\fnArial\fs30}See her back to the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.66,0:34:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.76,0:34:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,无需多言\N{\fnArial\fs30}No arguments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.00,0:34:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随后去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will join you afterwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.00,0:34:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.30,0:34:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.40,0:35:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀！杀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill! Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.83,0:35:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.33,0:36:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊！Crixus啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus! Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.13,0:36:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊！Crixus啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus! Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.76,0:36:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.43,0:36:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如约回归了战斗状态！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Returned to form as promised!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.23,0:36:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明回应了你的祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your prayers have been answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.13,0:36:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场闪电战极度简短\N{\fnArial\fs30}The match was overly brief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.40,0:36:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚巨大的财富 市民们理应看到这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good fortune to Capua, and all its deserving citizens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.26,0:36:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 再多玩一会儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, linger a moment!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.93,0:36:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们喝杯酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us have a drink{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.03,0:36:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,重温这辉煌的时刻…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and relive this glorious day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.96,0:36:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.80,0:36:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么消息如此重要 竟然打断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What news so important it interrupts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.56,0:37:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,得意洋洋的Batiatus？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the gloating of good Batiatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.03,0:37:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了行政官的篷车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The magistrate's caravan has been discovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.26,0:37:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在镇子外边\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the edge of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.16,0:37:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的护卫已遭杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}His guards murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.26,0:37:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.70,0:37:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有发现你父亲 但是有迹象指明\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was not among them, but there are tracks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.93,0:37:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回到城里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}leading back to the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.03,0:37:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,回卡普亚来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to Capua?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.86,0:37:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会有人做出此等叛变之举？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would anyone commit such treachery?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.63,0:37:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了勒索啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ransom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.53,0:37:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真让我担忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This burden saddens me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.30,0:37:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有我能帮得上忙的地方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I may be of any assistance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.20,0:37:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的热心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.00,0:37:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能处理妥当的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.83,0:37:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会召集我的手下协助搜寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will gather my men to aid in the search.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.53,0:37:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Numerius 非常欢迎你来我这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numerius, your presence is welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.96,0:37:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我会让他跟在我的身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I will have him by my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.30,0:37:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.50,0:37:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他脱离我的视线之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never let him out of my sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.56,0:37:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my oath on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.50,0:37:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.50,0:37:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找寻你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us to your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.06,0:38:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你传消息给我 我却像个普通奴隶般苦苦等候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You send message, yet I wait as a common slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.20,0:38:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.20,0:38:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要掩人耳目外出 并非易事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was difficult to move without notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.16,0:38:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,全城都警戒起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alarm is up across the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.50,0:38:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有话快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.03,0:38:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入了搜寻Calavius的队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I join the search for good Calavius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.90,0:38:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.90,0:38:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am aware of his absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.73,0:38:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的重中之重是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very matter I wish to broach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.30,0:38:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calavius的戒指！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calavius' ring!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.23,0:38:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shhh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.23,0:38:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小声点！小声点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Softly! Softly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.30,0:38:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么弄到这个的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you come by this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.46,0:38:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了达成你的目的 只好不择手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through means pressing upon your desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.66,0:38:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus抓住了他 意图将其杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus holds him captive, with intent of murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.50,0:38:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是Batiatus 也不能这么疯狂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madness, even for Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.90,0:38:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官Calavius侮辱了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magistrate Calavius insults him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.43,0:38:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻碍了他的野心之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}obstructs his ambitions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.16,0:38:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还从未见过Batiatus如此丧心病狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen Batiatus so unhinged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.03,0:38:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟他断绝关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would sever bonds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.26,0:38:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得自己跟他一样 遭灾受罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}least I find myself upon the cross beside him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.43,0:38:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calavius他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calavius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.90,0:38:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还活着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet lives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.36,0:38:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,危在旦夕\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the briefest of moments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.30,0:38:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被关在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he held?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.90,0:38:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 你嘴上说着断绝关系 实际上还是忠贞不二啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you speak of severing bonds, but remain firmly tethered!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.86,0:38:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不愿意对旧主愚忠下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hold no love for old loyalties, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.73,0:39:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是Calavius看到了我的脸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet Calavius has seen my face!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.16,0:39:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须逃离这城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must flee this city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.73,0:39:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得想个好办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}and would have proper means to do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.20,0:39:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.66,0:39:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当Batiatus和他的叛变\N{\fnArial\fs30}And more, when Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.60,0:39:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,土崩瓦解之时 你的酬劳还会更丰厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his treachery are laid to rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.10,0:39:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我们必须召集人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, we must gather men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.33,0:39:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你动手之前 Calavius可能就已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calavius would be dead before you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.06,0:39:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus已经着手实施计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus already moves towards his plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.26,0:39:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有武器吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you armed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.86,0:39:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一把匕首…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple dagger…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.16,0:39:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够切断绳索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to cut ropes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.40,0:39:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.43,0:39:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,机会稍纵即逝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or see opportunity fade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.10,0:40:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,医师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medicus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.16,0:40:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mira啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mira?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.20,0:41:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么杀他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you kill him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.46,0:41:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没得选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.66,0:41:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都必须接受命运的安排…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man must accept his fate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.86,0:41:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则就等着被命运摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or be destroyed by it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.03,0:41:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的命运之路吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this my path?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.13,0:41:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲜血与死亡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood and death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.83,0:41:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,上天注定你将永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have always been destined{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.70,0:41:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,给身边的人带来不幸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}for unfortunate things…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.56,0:42:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.96,0:42:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再一次离开我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not leave me again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.80,0:42:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.00,0:42:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 离开了我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you, who left…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.63,0:42:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你务必要留心旧的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must tend to the wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.43,0:42:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,被袭击了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attacked…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.36,0:43:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在路上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the road…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.40,0:43:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,突如其来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came out of nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.10,0:43:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,留心旧的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tend to the wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.16,0:43:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里 我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here. I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.53,0:43:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be still…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.80,0:43:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fevers broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.20,0:43:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天神真是眷顾你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods have blessed you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.86,0:44:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.46,0:44:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很眷顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.43,0:44:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找医师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will fetch medicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.76,0:44:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.40,0:44:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,解开皮带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release the straps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.50,0:44:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要单独和这人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would speak to this man, alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.56,0:44:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的何在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.76,0:44:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在走廊等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait in the corridor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.03,0:44:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人过来 就大声示警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound warning if anyone approaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.20,0:44:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我这么做吧 Mira\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do this for me, Mira.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.16,0:44:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会报答你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be in your debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.83,0:44:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他的任何踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no sign of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.36,0:44:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲可能被关在任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father could be held anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.66,0:44:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个值得尊敬的人 很容易被认出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a man of much esteem, and easily recognized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.26,0:44:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么可能不事先通知 就跑到大街上呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could he be moved through the streets without notice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.80,0:44:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.60,0:44:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.00,0:45:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有办法…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be a way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.80,0:45:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下水道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cisterns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.03,0:45:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在城市之下 四通八达！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They run beneath the city and beyond!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.03,0:45:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.03,0:45:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,火把！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torches!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.36,0:45:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Numerius 你很快就会找到父亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be with your father, soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.06,0:45:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.06,0:45:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的功劳 我绝不会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your part in this shall not be forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.20,0:45:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不能忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it shall not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.63,0:45:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calavius啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calavius…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.63,0:45:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.06,0:45:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They approach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.06,0:45:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须抓紧时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.06,0:45:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it is too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.63,0:45:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼓起勇气来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steel your fucking nerve!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.23,0:45:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会为你或其他任何人送命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not end murder by you or any man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.53,0:45:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想我的一贯作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider Ashur a spirit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.80,0:45:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连卡普亚都抛诸脑后了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Capua the world he left behind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.83,0:45:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ashur啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.23,0:45:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在我们上面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are upon us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.00,0:45:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须帮你解开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must get you free…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.20,0:46:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius 居然是你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solonius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.20,0:46:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.90,0:46:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seize him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.90,0:46:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该为你父亲报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father shall be avenged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.90,0:46:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius要为自己的所作所为 付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solonius will suffer for what he has done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.23,0:46:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有卡普亚人都会知道 你是什么破玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all of Capua will know you for the shit you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.96,0:46:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.13,0:47:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.76,0:47:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.16,0:47:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.86,0:47:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿开你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your hands off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.90,0:47:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.53,0:47:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sura她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.83,0:47:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从Neapolis带回来的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}The slave you were transporting from Neapolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.70,0:47:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我她怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what happened to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.76,0:47:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在路上 被袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were attacked, on the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.43,0:47:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们试图抓走她 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tried to get to her, but argh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.30,0:47:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伤在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your wound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.56,0:47:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伤在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the wound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.56,0:47:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了救我妻子弄的那个伤口 在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You earned trying to save my wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.76,0:47:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.06,0:47:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 告诉我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, tell me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.60,0:47:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only did…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.33,0:47:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听命行事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As commanded…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.36,0:47:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁下令取她性命的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who spoke the words that took her life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.43,0:47:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.76,0:48:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Bat…ia…tus…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bat…ia…tus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.50,0:48:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.83,0:48:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我把他放好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me restore him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.20,0:48:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心 我会负责…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will secure my straps…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.30,0:48:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要再提这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And never speak of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.53,0:48:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤口看起来并不致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wound did not appear fatal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.56,0:48:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候损伤并不是眼睛能看得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The damage was deeper than the eye could perceive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.56,0:48:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,医师说 他是被自己的血淹死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medicus tells he drowned in his own blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.56,0:48:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.13,0:48:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}A loose end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.16,0:48:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必再为此忧心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No longer needing to be tied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.40,0:48:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.00,0:49:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ashur 你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have played your part well, Ashur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.03,0:49:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我自己想象的 要好得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was greater hand than mine that conceived it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.93,0:49:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么容易骗过Solonius 让他相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solonius was easily deceived into believing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.20,0:49:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会背叛我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would betray me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.20,0:49:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他会相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I knew he would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.46,0:49:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绝对想不到 我是一直忠于你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never suspected my loyalty always lay with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.86,0:49:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个不知荣耀为何物的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who has no honor cannot imagine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.16,0:49:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难理解其他人的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}that trait in anyone else, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.43,0:49:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 拥有高于所有人的品质\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you, you have that quality above all others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.50,0:49:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该予以奖赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And shall be rewarded in kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.33,0:49:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如您所愿 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your will, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.90,0:49:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.00,0:49:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天神如此眷顾Batiatus家族！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods truly favor the house of Batiatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.03,0:49:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.76,0:49:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯死而复生了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus risen from the dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.63,0:49:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.46,0:49:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.66,0:49:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.56,0:49:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又找回自我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am myself again.{\r}
